Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ggtree(grouptree, aes(color=group))

works as expected.

You problem is after reroot the tree, the group information was removed by :

roottree <- root.phylo(grouptree, "Dlighti_7", resolve.root=TRUE)

You need to root the tree before grouping clades.

